    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e525933ed611580dfd3c3e32",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了让大家对苫小牧留下深刻的\r\n印象，我必须以精彩表现拿下胜利。\r\n现在的我……一定办得到！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d315821f2cf4e1574bbdd5d7599d3a86a26a0aeba73717d1a930805a69cc95e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
